title: Login
---
flowchart TD
    start([Start]) --> input[/Enter password/]
    users[(Users)] -->|lookup| check{Correct?}
    input --> check
    check -->|yes| open[Open session] --> stop([End])
    check -->|no| error@{ shape: display, label: "Show error" }
    error --> input
    open --> audit@{ shape: doc, label: "Audit log" }
